{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33174","headline":"道中早发 · 司马扎","name":"道中早发","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"野店鸡一声，萧萧客车动。\n西峯带晓月，十里犹相送。\n繁弦满长道，羸马四蹄重。\n遥羡青楼人，锦衾方远梦。\n功名不我与，孤剑何所用。\n行役难自休，家山忆秋洞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司马扎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33174.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33174","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}